      "content": "it’s just that even with support, the world doesn't change. the hostility is just... always there. it feels like i'm being forced to pay a tax for just being me, and i'm just so empty. i look at people who don't have to fight and it makes me wonder if there's actually any point to the struggle for me. is it even worth it to keep trying to force a life that feels like it's constantly rejecting you?",
